# No map images in git. Masters are fetched from the Inkarnate CDN
# (scripts/fetch-maps.ps1, manifest maps/sources.tsv, committed); tiles and crops are
# generated locally (scripts/gen-tiles.py, scripts/map-crop.ps1). Cold-start sequence:
# fetch-maps.ps1 -> gen-tiles.py.
maps/**/*.png
maps/**/*.webp
maps/**/*.jpg
maps/**/*.jpeg
maps/**/*.gif
app/node_modules